["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/vulnerabilityExploitabilityAssessment", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "A reference to a Vulnerability Exploitability eXchange (VEX) statement which provides information on whether a product is impacted by a specific vulnerability in an included package and, if affected, whether there are actions recommended to remediate. See also [NTIA VEX one-page summary](https://ntia.gov/files/ntia/publications/vex_one-page_summary.pdf).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
